 are for  your business I don't know what it is  you gotta have certain criterias to make  it a ten when you have a ten you green  it out this week was a ten this week was  a nine but I gauge my week after week  after week so once I have this set up  then I look at my following week that's  coming up for my schedule so one is 90  days the other one is the next week  coming up this prepares me mentally and  what's coming up then  week number three so look no matter who  it is whatever kind of a business you're  on everybody typically has a handful of  people they can contact on Sunday night  or Saturday this is like your main core  team right so I asked them I said listen  this week we have this project coming  out what's going on with this and this  week we got this gonna battle are you  prepared with this how are we fully  prepared for this one thing that's  coming up to Marcus we have to be yes we  are I'm gonna communicate typically on  Sunday night with five to seven of my  direct people that I'm working with so  they are also prepared for the week  because if I wake on Monday we're  already behind the eight ball number  four so the next thing I do is I make a  list of people that need to hear from me  this week meaning vendors partners  executives sales clients who needs to  hear from me and what kind of message is  it is it an encouraging messages and an  accountability is that a report is it an  update is that a direction is that a  challenge we need to improve in  such-and-such area what is it I may get  that as a list of people I need to  followup with and I add that to my to-do  list number five so now that I've done  that my to-do list is gonna tell me any  big meetings that have coming up a board  meeting right maybe I'm having a  investor meeting I'm having a meeting  with certain carriers insurance  companies and what do I have to prepare  for this meeting right so stuff that I  need to prepare data quote if it's a  sales training whatever it is I need to  prepare for that and others if it's  investors what other deck do I need to  have a presentation of PowerPoint if  it's not a lot great if it is a lot I'll  make sure the people that are helping me  with this start putting it together as  well number six so one of the things I  like to do is I like to send gifts cards  you know any kind of certain things  flowers edible arrangement I will make a  list who is supposed to be getting  something from me this week that list is  also made on my to-do list by the way  this is family business finance every  one of them who needs to hear from me as  far as a gift goes and that goes out the  following week number seven so depending  if you're married you have kids you're  single family mom dad brother system  boyfriend girlfriend whatever maybe I  ask what do we have going on this week  do we have a birthday going out do we  have wedding what do you need me at I  need to know what is needed for me this  week specially if you have kids it's  very critical for you to know hey we  have a family thing going on with the  teacher here on such and such date great  I'm ready for it and we move on number  eight so next thing is I'm reading I'm  reading a book I'm reading articles I'm  reading news I'm  reading industry stuff that's taking  place I'm going up and studying right I  gotta get my mind mentally prepared for  the crazy week that's about to come up  and I feed myself for about an hour  reading on Sunday night number nine so  right after that what I like to do study  numbers I mean I love studying numbers  because it tells a story right so yes I  track my activity on 90 days and what I  got coming up this week  but what I do next is study numbers  actual numbers if you're doing real  estate how many homes did you sell last  month the month prior to that I sit  there and I look at how many people that  we sell a policy to how many people was  a week before how about the week prior  to that what are we doing Q 1 to Q 2  what's Q 3 looking like last year's Q 4  I'm looking at all of those numbers  together to prepare me and know exactly  where my business is at today because I  don't want to be caught with a surprise  when I go in knowing wait a minute this  one that is low  this one's high I want to know all of it  before I start my week number 10 so this  last one we sound weird too but I  prepare my clothes for the following day  because I don't like to wake up in the  morning lucky my closet saying what am I  gonna work if I had a my ride we're a  white shirt every single day with blue  jeans and flip-flops right but some days  I'm meeting with investors so I put my  suits up to tie all this others on my  workout clothes night before so in the  morning I don't need to do any thinking  about clothes so listen the whole  purpose of doing this is for two reasons  one for you to be prepared for your week  so you're not really stressed out going  to sleep at night and two to actually  have a strategy going into your week by  the way  think about what a small percentage of  people actually spend a couple hours on  Sunday night preparing for their week  10% you're beating 90 percent of your  competition if you do this so for some  of you that are watching us impact I  wish I had this on PDF Mario our hero  has prepared a one-page PDF you got a  click on a link below download it take  it out and look at and say here's what  I'm gonna start doing on a weekly basis  and by the way for some of you that are  saying man this I found so many leaks in  my business if I'm not doing this  there's a video this video itself or  consulting could be a hundred thousand  dollars for me to spend time breaking  down the leaks people having their  businesses but this video is also in  value teaming the title of this video is  how to find leaks in your business if  you saw this video go to that video as  well because that's going to help you  find other leaks in your business that  you currently have so with that being  said  the way if you haven't yet subscribed to  this channel click on that alert button  forget about just to subscribe click on  alert button so you're one of the first  to get any episode that comes out on  value Tim and take everybody bye-bye

